<h2>Publish on GitHub Pages</h2>

<p>The slideit action checks the deck, builds the site (and a PDF) and uploads it for Pages:</p>

<code lang=yaml>
  jobs:
    build:
      runs-on: ubuntu-latest
      steps:
        - uses: actions/checkout@v4
        - uses: geraldserafin/md-slides@action-v1
          with:
            deck: talk
            pdf: 'true'
    deploy:
      needs: build
      runs-on: ubuntu-latest
      environment: github-pages
      steps:
        - uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4
</code>

<p>Or press <b>Use this template</b> on <c>geraldserafin/slideit-template</c>: a deck and this workflow, ready to push.</p>

<notes>
  Settings, Pages, Source: GitHub Actions, once. The action's inputs: deck, output, pdf, check, pages, hub, version.
</notes>
